        {
            "byteMode": true,
            "command": "env",
            "description": "clearEnv清除继承环境后注入GOOD=value加字节ff；GNU env逐条按原始字节输出环境项，预期RC=0、stdout十六进制为474f4f443d76616c7565ff0a、stderr为空",
